*.dll binary
*.bin binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.rar binary
*.gz binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.msi binary
*.torrent binary
*.ico binary
